415 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (However, I believe that you will not be among the statistics of those who do not complete their graduate studies. Our office is committed to creating an enabling environment for you to complete your studies by providing timely services. The Office of the Academic Registrar works hand in hand with the Directorate of Research and Graduate Training \(DRGT\) on issues related to admission, enrolment registration, identity cards, timetables, exams, results, and graduation. Think of us as your campus tour guides. We collaborate with the Faculties and Departments for these tasks.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [16]
>>
endobj
416 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Do get in touch with the team whenever you need assistance.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
417 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (I wish you all the best as you embark on an exciting journey filled with learning, exploration, and some fun, of course. We're excited to have you on board!)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
418 0 obj
<<
