421 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Congratulations on joining MUST, the premier university of science and technology in Uganda! Established in 1989, we've been building a reputation for excellence in teaching, research, community engagement, and most importantly, helping students like YOU succeed.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
422 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText <>
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
423 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Transitioning into graduate studies can seem overwhelming, with numerous people, policies, procedures, and paperwork to navigate. Don't worry, we have put together resources to help you find your bearings. These include:)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
424 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (7)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [21]
>>
endobj
425 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H1
/T (MESSAGE FROM THE DIRECTOR, DIRECTORATE OF RESEARCH AND GRADUATE TRAINING)
/E (MESSAGE FROM THE DIRECTOR, DIRECTORATE OF RESEARCH AND GRADUATE TRAINING)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
426 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 204 0 R
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
427 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (You have thus joined a community that will encourage you, support you, challenge you and inspire you. It is as diverse a community as you will find anywhere and one that is brimming with energy and excitement. Again, we are so glad that you are part of us.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
428 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (In order to help you get off to a good start, I want you to know that there are many staff members who are available to you for guidance and support. You should make sure to say hello and get to know your Department and Faculty Postgraduate Coordinators and DRGT Graduate Training Section. If you are ever confused about who to turn to for help, I encourage you to stop by DRGT and ask for assistance in getting in touch with the right person. All of our dedicated and caring MUST staff are committed to making your time here as successful)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
429 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (and fulfilling as possible. I believe that the time you will spend with us will provide some of the most meaningful experiences of your academic career. MUST community is a high quality learning environment that supports your academic success, personal growth, and your unique connections. This community is a place where you will live and learn together with an amazing group of course-mates, and create a bond with each other that may well last a lifetime. The best ways to immerse yourself in the MUST community is to read carefully and understand these Joining Instructions, participate in as many of our Welcome events as possible and to be available for the planned activities of your academic programme.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
