453 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Admitted students are required to pay a non-refundable tuition fee deposit before they pick their admission letters. The fee paid is prescribed by the University Council. The fees are stipulated on the admission letter.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
454 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Any admitted student who for some reason is unable to register or take up his/her place in the University by the end of the registration period will be required to re-apply for admission in the next admission cycle following the same application procedures and compete with the applicants for that academic year.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
