465 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Registration is carried out at the Directorate of Research and Graduate Training at the time of reporting. Every student SHOULD register within two \(2\) weeks at the beginning of the first semester, after which they should access University facilities/services.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [22]
>>
endobj
466 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Failure to register may lead to cancellation of your offer. Students shall be registered if they are in possession of an admission letter, have all of functional fees plus Identity card and National Council for Higher Education fees and have the required academic documents as stated in the admission letter.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [23]
>>
endobj
467 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Any first year student who will not have registered within the first 2 weeks from the beginning of the academic year shall be deemed to have declined the offer of a place at the University. His/her place shall accordingly be offered to another student at the time of change of programme/subject exercise.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [24]
>>
endobj
