/S /P
/ActualText (Programmes offered at MUST can be got from the website www.must.ac.ug.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
endobj
712 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (How do I apply to MUST?)
/Pg 30 0 R
>>
endobj
713 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (You can apply online through https://applications.must.ac.ug.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [3 4]
>>
endobj
714 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (When can I apply to the University?)
/Pg 30 0 R
>>
endobj
715 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Application to Undergraduate and Postgraduate programmes are usually open from January to June every year. The calls for applications are run on print media and our website and social media platforms. PhD applications are received all year round.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
716 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (What are the admissions requirements?)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
717 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (The detailed entry requirements can be got from the call for applications which can be found on the University website registrar.must.ac.ug or print media/social media.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
718 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (When do applications close?)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
719 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (See the call for applications on the University website www.must.ac.ug or closing date for applications.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [9 10]
>>
endobj
720 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (How can I follow up on my application?)
/Pg 30 0 R
>>
endobj
721 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Progress on applications can be made through the online portal. You can also send an email to admissions@must.ac.ug for undergraduate applications or pgadmissions@must.ac.ug for postgraduate applications.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [11 12 13]
>>
endobj
