727 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Yes, but you must first have your academic documents equated by the UNEB for O and A level equating or NCHE for Certificates, Diploma and Degree equating. Please visit UNEB website \(www.uneb.ac.ug\) and NCHE website \(www.unche.of.ug\) for more information.)
/Pg 30 0 R
/K [17 18]
>>
endobj
